{"unit_id":"CkEFFAF__dsh-plugin-devkit#card-zh","repo":"CkEFFAF/dsh-plugin-devkit","commit":"8af209dd6f0af52f76d0a90129ff7525ce2ab2cb","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Plugin DevKit 为 DSH 插件开发提供运行时检查、隔离启动、宿主契约测试和客户端槽位预览。它把 dsh-debugger 挂入 profile 并注册 /debug 命令，可查看插件与服务状态、调用事件和追踪；debug-boot 用临时 profile 启动被测插件；dsh-plugin-test 提供假宿主和断言；preview 可在明暗主题及窄宽视口中渲染客户端模块。适合开发和排查 DSH 插件的开发者。需 Node.js 22 以上及兼容 DSH；不要求额外账号。","source":"generated","evidence":["packages/dsh-debugger/index.mjs:24-48","packages/dsh-debugger/src/command.mjs:23","packages/dsh-debug-boot/src/index.mjs:9-35","packages/dsh-plugin-test/index.mjs:16-41","packages/dsh-plugin-preview/src/shell.mjs:22-27","package.json:38-42"]}
